PUBLIC_REVIEWS=[{"name":"Lisa M.","location":"Denver, CO","rating":5,"text":"My dog needed emergency surgery on a Saturday night. I checked my Scratchpay options in under a minute and had a 0% plan confirmed before the vet even finished the intake form. No hard pull, no stress.","amount":"\$3,800","purpose":"Emergency surgery"},{"name":"David K.","location":"Portland, OR","rating":5,"text":"I'd been rejected by two banks before finding Scratchpay. The soft inquiry check was the thing that got me — I could actually see my options without damaging my already-thin credit. Approved same day.","amount":"\$2,200","purpose":"Diagnostic imaging & treatment"},{"name":"Sarah T.","location":"Nashville, TN","rating":5,"text":"The 0% APR plan meant I paid exactly what the vet quoted me — not a dollar more. The monthly payment fit my budget and I knew the full breakdown before I signed anything. Exactly what I needed.","amount":"\$1,600","purpose":"Orthopedic care"}]
